OpenTSense (G93a): the steady grid dump prints 6 decimals instead of 2 (0.01 K), for regression checks. Output
format only; no change to the model.
Amendment 1 (7 Nov 2026): LINE_SIZE 65536 -> 1048576. The power trace is one line with one value per grid cell
of every source layer; two 60 x 60 dies need ~115k characters and HotSpot stopped with "line too long".
Buffer size only; no change to the model.
--- a/temperature_grid.c
+++ b/temperature_grid.c
@@ -1284,7 +1284,7 @@
     fprintf(fp, "Layer %d:\n", n);
     for(i=0; i < model->rows; i++){
       for(j=0; j < model->cols; j++){
-          fprintf(fp, "%d\t%.2f\n", i*model->cols+j,
+          fprintf(fp, "%d\t%.6f\n", i*model->cols+j,
                   model->last_steady->cuboid[n][i][j]);
       }
     }
--- a/util.h
+++ b/util.h
@@ -26,7 +26,7 @@
 #define RAND_SEED		1500450271
 
 #define STR_SIZE		512
-#define LINE_SIZE		65536
